# Build artifacts from build.sh when OUT is left at the default (this dir):
# the 'fuzz' and 'campaign' helpers, the per-target binaries, debug
# bundles, the staged <target>.dict copies, the working corpus the
# launcher writes new inputs into, and campaign findings.  The tracked
# seed corpora live in <target>_corpus/ and the source dictionaries in
# dictionaries/, neither of which is matched here.
#
# build.sh itself is generated by configure from build.sh.in (the tracked
# template); for an in-tree build it lands here, so ignore it too.
/build.sh
/fuzz
/campaign
/parse
/grep
/unserialize
/dcf
/*.dict
*.dSYM/
/corpus/
/findings/
